±Mahāyānottaratantraśāstra;
                       *Ratnagotravibhāgamahāyānottaratantraśāstra; Ratnagotravibhāgaśāstra;
                       Ratnagotravibhāgamahāyānottaratantraśātra

bibl.note:
KANSHOENRON SHAKU (Guan suo yuan lun shi) 觀所縁論釋 Gohō 護法 (Dharmapāla);
                       Gijō 義淨. S. XX 10; 卍 XXI 2; Nj. 1174; K. 625. *Kanshoen[nenron]shaku. Cf.
                       1624 唐 30

HŌBENSHIN RON (Fang bian xin lun) 方便心論 Upāyahṛdaya? 龍樹 long2 shu4
                       (Nāgārjuna) ?]; Kikkaya 吉迦夜 ji2 jia1 ye4 (Kiṃkārya?). S. XIX 1; 卍 XXII 5;
                       Nj. 1257; Kyik., ronjū-bu I; K. 627 後魏 30

NIKENSHI MOM MUGAGI KYŌ (Ni qian zi wen wu wo yi jing) 尼乾子問無我義經
                       *Nairātmyaparipṛcchā 馬鳴 (Aśvaghoṣa); Nisshō 日稱, etc. S. XXIV 9; Z. I II 1;
                       Kyik., ronjū-bu II; K. 1492. Cf. 846 宋 69

ENSHŌ RON (Yuan sheng lun) 縁生論 Pratītyasamutpādaśāstra 鬱楞伽 (Ullaṇgha);
                       Datsumagyūta 逹摩笈多 (Dharmagupta). S. XXIV 3; 卍 XXII 3; Nj. 1227; Kyik.,
                       ronjū-bu VI; K. 641. Cf. 1653 隋 30

KŌDAI HOTSUGAN JU (Guang da fa yuan song) 廣大發願頌 Ryūju 龍樹 long2 shu4
                       (Nāgārjuna); Sego 施護, etc. S. XXIV 9; 卍 XXVI 9; Nj. 1376; Kyik., ronjū-bu V;
                       K. 1461 宋 67

KASHŌSENNIN SETSU INYONIN GYŌ (Jia she xian ren shuo yi nü ren jing)
                       迦葉仙人説醫女人經 Hōken 法賢 fa3 xian2 S. XXIV 9; 卍 XV 5; Nj. 883; Kyik., ronjū-bu V;
                       K. 1219 宋 64

NINNŌGOKOKUHANNYAHARAMITSUKYŌ SHO JIMBŌ KI (Ren wang hu guo ban ruo bo
                       luo mi jing shu shen bao ji) 仁王護國般若波羅蜜經疏神寶記 Zengatsu 善月 shan4 yue4 S. XXX 8;
                       卍 XXXIII 5; Nj. 1567. Cf. 245, 1705 宋 96

BOSATSUKAI GISHO (Pu sa jie yi shu) 菩薩戒義疏 Chigi 智顗; Kanjō 灌頂. S. XXXI 7;
                       卍 XXXIII 2; Z. I LIX 3; Nj. 1554; Kyik., rissho-bu II. *Kaisho. Cf. 1484 隋
                       97

KŌRAIKOKU FUSHŌZENJI SHŪSHINKETSU (Gao li guo pu zhao chan shi xiu xin
                       jue) 高麗國普照禪師修心訣 Chitotsu 知訥 zhi1 ne4 S. XXXIV 10; Z. II XVIII 5; Nj. 1648;
                       K.S. 41. *[Fushōzenji]shūshinketsu. 高麗 80

BUSHŪI RON (Bu zhi yi lun) 部執異論 ±Samayabhedoparacanacakra 世友 (Vasumitra)
                       ]; Shindai 眞諦 (Paramārtha). S. XXIV 4; 卍 XXV 4; Nj. 1285; K. 975.
                       *Buishūron. Cf. 2031, 2032 陳

YUIMAKYŌ GISHO (Wei mo jing yi shu) 維摩經義疏 Shōtoku taishi 聖徳太子. Zs. 57;
                       Kyik., kyōsho-bu XVI; NZ. XIV, 1. *Yuimakitsukyōgisho, *Yuimakyōsho,
                       *Yuimajōgūsho. Cf. 475 日本

ISSANKOKUSHI GOROKU (Yi shan guo shi yu lu) 一山國師語録 Issan Ichinei 一山一寧;
                       Ryōshin了眞, etc. Zs. 302. *Issankokushimyōjikōsaidaishigoroku,
                       *Issanneioshōgoroku, *Neiissanroku, *Daiunroku. 日本

YUGASHIJIRON BUMMON KI (Yu qie shi di lun fen men ji) 瑜伽師地論分門記 Hōjō 法成;
                       Chiezan 智慧山. I: P. 2035, St. 2552 (G. 5823); II, III: P. 2053; IV, V: P.
                       2190, P. 2080, Coll. Yamamoto; VI: P. 2093. Cf. 1579 唐
